// API transfers and their outcome, newest first.
// Outcomes: confirmed, refused (RIPE Atlas said no, nothing moved),
// uncertain (no usable answer, the credits may have moved) and unrecorded (RIPE Atlas accepted it
// but the pledge row could not be updated). Uncertain and unrecorded ones need a person; see the
// runbook. Project and pledge ids are the RowKeys in the projects and pledges tables.
AppTraces
| where Message has '"event":"transfer"'
| extend e = parse_json(Message)
| where tostring(e.event) == "transfer"
| project TimeGenerated, Outcome = tostring(e.outcome), UpstreamStatus = tostring(e.upstreamStatus),
    ProjectId = tostring(e.projectId), PledgeId = tostring(e.pledgeId), OperationId
| order by TimeGenerated desc
